        "original_id": "06e3688b-c692-56c5-9e8d-fd3ce283cc58",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Seth Rollins, Colby Daniel Lopez, Dean Ambrose, Jirair S. Hovnanian, Kofi Kingston, Big E, Xavier Woods\n- Organizations: WWE, The New Day\n- Products: WWE Raw Tag Team Championship, SmackDown Tag Team Championship\n- Places: New Jersey\n- Roles: professional wrestler, actor, home builder\n\nFacts:\n- Jirair S. Hovnanian was born on June 9, 1927, and was an Armenian Iraqi-American home builder based in New Jersey.\n- Colby Daniel Lopez was born on May 28, 1986, and is an American professional wrestler and actor.\n- Jirair S. Hovnanian died on August 14, 2007.\n- Colby Daniel Lopez is signed to WWE under the ring name Seth Rollins and performs on the Raw brand.\n- Seth Rollins and Dean Ambrose are the current WWE Raw Tag Team Champions.\n- Seth Rollins is in his second reign as an individual Raw Tag Team Champion and his first reign with Dean Ambrose.\n- Dean Ambrose and Seth Rollins are in their first reign as a team as WWE Raw Tag Team Champions.\n- Kofi Kingston is signed to WWE on the SmackDown brand under the ring name Kofi Kingston.\n- Kofi Kingston is a member of The New Day with Big E and Xavier Woods.\n- Kofi Kingston is currently a co-holder of the SmackDown Tag Team Championship in his second reign with his New Day teammates.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
